<title>USA: Germantown, Tenn., won by SunTrust Capital.</title>
<headline>Germantown, Tenn., won by SunTrust Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunTrust Capital Markets, Inc said it won $9.680 million of Germantown, Tenn., general obligation and refunding bonds, Series 19 96, with a true interest cost of 5.01 percent.</p>
</text>
